// Pestiféré (class 12) - server side of the plague tank.
//
// The spine: the class infects itself with up to three plagues, each of which gives something and takes
// something. Virulence (how many are carried, 0-3) scales all three, Contagion hands the enemy versions to
// the pack and keeps the carrier's own alive, and Détonation spends the rot the pack has accumulated.
//
// Spell data contract (rows generated by localTools/patchSinisterStrike.ps1; these are the slots the
// scripts drive - everything else about the spells is data, and the scripts do not touch it):
//   90200 Frappe putride     EFFECT_1 triggers Pourriture; Fossoyeur scales the hit and adds a stack
//   90202 Détonation         EFFECT_0 SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE, caster-centred area (Thunder Clap layout)
//   90206 Détonation         EFFECT_0 SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE on one enemy: Détonation en chaîne's jump
//   90207/90208 Sépulcre     EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_DAMAGE, every tick dealt by the script
//   90211 Carapace nécrosée  EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_TAKEN, EFFECT_2 SPELL_AURA_MOD_RESISTANCE_PCT
//                            (EFFECT_1, the movement slow, is data only)
//   90213 Chair putride      EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_HEAL
//   90215 Peste virulente    EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_DONE, EFFECT_1 SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_DAMAGE
//   90256 Charnier ambulant  EFFECT_0 SPELL_EFFECT_DUMMY on every enemy within 10 yd
//   90265 Purge cathartique  EFFECT_0 SPELL_EFFECT_DUMMY on the caster
//   90268 Sépulcre           EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_SCHOOL_ABSORB, all schools, 8 sec
//   90243-90245 Mains putrides  a dummy aura that procs on off-hand hits (proc flags and chance are data)
//   90205 Pourriture         EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_DAMAGE: each tick may grant Fièvre
//   90223 Flaque de bile     a dynamic object: EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_DAMAGE,
//                            EFFECT_1 SPELL_AURA_MOD_DAMAGE_PERCENT_DONE
//   90224 Morsure fétide     one weapon damage effect, scaled by the Pourriture on the target
//   90225 Riposte purulente  one weapon damage effect, usable after a dodge, parry or block (aura state data)
//   90226 Carapace suintante EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_SCHOOL_ABSORB
//   90227 Bond putride       EFFECT_0 SPELL_EFFECT_CHARGE
//   90284 Vomissure          EFFECT_0 SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE, cone
//   90287 Avatar de la peste EFFECT_0 SPELL_AURA_MOD_SCALE
// The three self plagues have no duration in data; this module sets it when the carrier leaves combat.

